Swift 6.3.2 / macOS 26 SDK — independent of this task. Demonstrated by isolating ONLY
pre-existing files: excluding them yields BUILD SUCCEEDED + TEST SUCCEEDED above; my code
is never the cause. The pre-existing breakages observed:
  • `@Previewable @State … return staged{…}` in many `#if DEBUG` `*.Previews.swift` files
    (Input/HelpIcon/Checkbox/RangeSlider/Accordion/CopyButton/SearchInput/CopyLinkButton…):
    Swift 6.3.2 rejects `return` in a multi-statement `#Preview` ViewBuilder + enforces
    argument-declaration order — both were tolerated by the baseline's pinned toolchain.
