    AlertStudioPage.ViewModelTests.swift, Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/GDPRExportPageModelTests.swift).
None is in this unit's scope; all are git-unmodified at HEAD by this task (git status shows
only my Charging/** additions, AppShell.swift +1, and Localizable.xcstrings). This is the
SAME pre-existing/out-of-scope full-xcodebuild RED the sibling P7 page logs recorded (e.g.
